  "notes": [
    "USB power-only GCT USB4135. LP223439 external pack with PCM and 10 kΩ NTC, pin 1 black/−, 2 yellow/NTC, 3 red/+. Verify pack polarity at incoming inspection.",
    "SPV1050 charges its own reservoir. BATT_CONN opens a source-side P-channel switch only after cold-start EOC. BQ24074 is the sole LiPo CC/CV charger for both inputs.",
    "VBUS priority TPS2116. SYS_AON follows the cell in darkness; regulated 4.4 V when enough input is available. VSEL grounded; RT6160A power-on default 3.3 V; I2C 0x75 on centrally pulled-up VMAIN bus.",
    "J103 and TP101–TP106 are unpopulated copper. PV sign and strain relief must be maintained by the off-board harness. See docs/power.md."
  ]
